        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>新手佩戴水晶常见30个问题</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #d9dcdf;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .card {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fbfbfa 0%, #f4f2ef 60%, #eceae6 100%);\n    border: 10px solid #e3e5e6;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #cfd2d4, 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 22px 26px 30px 26px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 6px 0 0 0;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #ffffff;\n  }\n  h1.title .line2 {\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .num30 {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 46px;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 14px 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  .divider .bar {\n    height: 3px;\n    background: #b5651d;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .divider .knot {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 18px;\n    border: 3px solid #b5651d;\n    margin: 0 6px;\n    background: #f7f5f2;\n  }\n  .qa {\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .q {\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #1f1f1f;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .q span.qtext { display: inline-block; }\n  .a {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    color: #3a3a3a;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .a .item {\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .marker {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 17px;\n    height: 17px;\n    line-height: 17px;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: #4a7fc1;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    vertical-align: 2px;\n  }\n  /* stone image placeholders */\n  .placeholder {\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #ffffff 0%, #cfcfcf 45%, #9c9c9c 100%);\n    font-size: 7px;\n    color: #555;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .stone1 { width: 46px; height: 46px; margin-left: 10px; }\n  .stone2 { width: 46px; height: 46px; margin-left: 10px; }\n  .stone3 { width: 46px; height: 46px; margin-left: 10px; }\n  .stone4 { width: 56px; height: 56px; margin-left: 10px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"card\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">新手佩戴水晶<span class=\"line2\">常见<span class=\"num30\">30</span>个问题</span></h1>\n\n  <div class=\"divider\">\n    <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n    <div class=\"knot\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"qa\">\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      <span class=\"qtext\">Q:水晶戴左手还是右手?</span>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder stone1\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 10px;\">[Photo: 圆形水晶珠]</figure>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"a\">\n      <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"marker\">1</span>黄水晶、草莓晶、紫水晶、海蓝宝、粉晶、</span>\n      <span class=\"item\" style=\"padding-left:0;\">月光石、萤石等常佩戴在左手;</span>\n      <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"marker\">2</span>黑/银曜石、白水晶、虎眼石等常佩戴在右手。</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"qa\">\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      <span class=\"qtext\">Q:哪些水晶不能碰水?</span>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder stone2\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 10px;\">[Photo: 红色水晶珠]</figure>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"a\">\n      太阳石、方解石、萤石、孔雀石、天青石<br>\n      青金石、海纹石、月光石、天河石、绿松石<br>\n      蓝铜矿、蓝晶石、堇青石、紫龙晶、紫锂辉石<br>\n      透石膏、灰月光、赤铁矿、紫锂云母\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"qa\">\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      <span class=\"qtext\">Q:水晶怎么消磁?</span>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder stone3\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 10px;\">[Photo: 粉色水晶珠]</figure>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"a\">\n      碎石消磁、海盐消磁、鼠尾草消磁、月光消磁<br>\n      流水消磁\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"qa\">\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      <span class=\"qtext\">Q:不佩戴水晶的时候放哪里?</span>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder stone4\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 10px;\">[Photo: 花斑水晶球]</figure>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"a\">\n      <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"marker\">1</span>可以放在装有消磁石的盒子里存放起来;</span>\n      <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"marker\">2</span>可以放在水晶簇或水晶洞里面;</span>\n      <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"marker\">3</span>可以放一个软布在木盒,然后将水晶放里面。</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
